# Morrowlamp Game Workshop — development noise only.
#
# Nothing required to build, test or understand the project belongs here.
# Source, cartridges, tests, documentation, Workshop code and procedural art
# code are all tracked. If you find yourself adding a source path below,
# something has gone wrong.

# --- editor and OS metadata ---
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- compiled adventures ---
# BUILD GAME output is a build product, reproducible from the cartridge and
# the Machine at any time. The tests write theirs to a temp directory; these
# patterns catch copies left in the tree during manual verification.
/dist/
/build/
_p[0-9]*.html
_built-*.html
_node.html
the-sunken-crown.html
captains-thistle.html
sir-crumbly.html
my-adventure*.html
*.cartridge.json

# --- temporary test and preview output ---
/tmp/
*.tmp
*.log
morrowlamp-build-*/

# --- local development scratch ---
scratch/
notes.local.md
